BLK_FEAT_SYNCHRONOUS ON TOP OF THIS - REJECTED 2026-09-25 (paging plan item
4, patches/attic/item4-mmc-sync-swap/): advertising the flag while this
file polls 4 KiB reads makes swapon set SWP_SYNCHRONOUS_IO. faultlat, same
boot, x3: swap-in fault p50 1143-1172 -> 1091-1101 us (needed -100), mean
and p99 WORSE (synchronous swap-out writes). Not worth a flag.
